  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Climate Resilience  Humanitarian Response (Central, and Southern Pakistan) Component: Building Resilience and Addressing Vulnerability to Emergencies (BRAVE) Programme in Pakistan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FAO is joining a consortium of five partners, including the International Organization for Migration (IOM), CARE Pakistan, Islamic Relief Pakistan (IRP), and UNICEF, in a proposal for the BRAVE program call. FAO will provide strategic technical services to consortium partners, government counterparts, and downstream organizations, as well as direct humanitarian assistance to local beneficiaries. Additionally, FAO will contribute to strengthening institutional capacity for a more effective humanitarian response.</narrative>
  </description>
